**Recommended Mitigation:** Apply the checks-effects-interactions pattern: update the user's balance before making the external call. For example:
```
function withdraw(uint256 amount) public {
    require(balances[msg.sender] >= amount);
    balances[msg.sender] -= amount; // State update first
    (bool ok, ) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}("");
    require(ok);
}
```
Alternatively, use a reentrancy guard modifier to prevent recursive calls.
'''

